                "text": "*   Inertia Engineering utilized Level AI and Service AI at Dawn West, Queensland, achieving earthworks balanced within 200 m³, which resulted in savings of approximately $2.5 million compared to the initial design surface."
              }
            },
            {
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                2,
                3,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "endIndex": 1227,
                "startIndex": 1170,
                "text": "Designs that typically took weeks were completed in days."
              }
            },
            {
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                2,
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "endIndex": 1390,
                "startIndex": 1228,
                "text": "*   Stantec used Level AI to compare six-warehouse layouts in Ontario, returning grading, retaining-wall, and earthworks quantities in less than a day per option."
              }
            },
            {
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
